        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli mbwaamba aa-Ahabu mwana wa-Kolaya a-Zedekiya mwana wa-Maaseya, bamusinsimina zyakubeja muzina lyangu. Ncobeni njoobaaba mumaanza aa-Nebukadinezara mwami wa-Babuloni, nkabela uyoobajaya mumeso aanu. ",
